# ── exact-pin × measured, NO BAND — the glob guard ─────────────────────────
# ⛔ THE ROW AN EARLIER DRAFT GOT WRONG, AND THE ERROR IS THE POINT. MIN_FIXTURES
# used to be a `>=` glob guard and was adopted as `grow-only` on that basis. At
# dc0b0024b it is an `assert_eq!` EXACT PIN, changed precisely because `>=` is
# blind in the direction the corpus actually moves: a corpus of 238 against a
# constant of 237 gives `238 >= 237` → PASS, which is how two spectests landed
# unratcheted. Declaring this `grow-only` would have written that blindness into
# the registry. NO BAND: corpus size is a file count, deterministic, so there is
# no jitter for a band to absorb.
